    // and the per-attempt abort timeout. Fee quotes have no per-instance cache
    // to fall back on, so every failure surfaces — this fetcher only adds its
    // observability emission before re-throwing the helper's canonical KitError
    // unchanged. The emitted `error` is the originating cause where the helper
    // recorded one (e.g. the network error or the synthesized HTTP error),
    // matching the object this fetcher emitted when it owned the ladder inline.
    let quote;
